CLAP text tower (ONNX export)

This directory contains a work derived from the model
laion/larger_clap_music_and_speech, published by LAION on Hugging Face
(https://huggingface.co/laion/larger_clap_music_and_speech) under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. A copy of that licence is in the file LICENSE beside
this one.

Modification statement: exported to ONNX, text tower only. The text encoder,
its projection and a final L2 normalisation were exported to
text_encoder.onnx, and the model's tokenizer to tokenizer.json, by Cablewrap
Creative Ltd. on 2026-08-10 with music/indexer/export_text_encoder.py (model
id, dimension and parameter count are recorded in manifest.json). The audio
tower was not exported, and the weights were not otherwise changed.
